    "formula": [
      "At the end of origin month t, sum the latest four newsy-month returns known by t.",
      "Subtract the expanding mean of that four-newsy-month sum over strictly earlier origins.",
      "Flip the demeaned signal when target month t+1 is newsy.",
      "Estimate the expanding OLS slope with intercept on origins through t-1, whose realized targets are known by t.",
      "The paper portfolio excess weight is slope times flipped demeaned signal; this unit uses only its sign."
    ],
